{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30005_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:49bd2a7f51460ebbb087c510d9e77df6b8f2b278dfb1735b6a73622e2cb42814",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8bcae9cfbbed412af82cce0eab4f79d44bab6eadc374991cc1cf8c7aeaf28af",
      "text": "演出结束后，有什么安排吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c9ca2c8266d0cb4377e774c00060547773a364e479eb045ab33ce23c1a1da4f",
      "text": "啊，没什么大不了的事啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7db44347cee03133c662460e65acf1d832b03cfbd5002d3d3522d9b85ec017c6",
      "text": "比、比起那个，●●●●プロデューサー，\n演出之后有什么安排吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5f8e5ac768939a447f71330cc7753501cc64ffb401335bcc381173d4982482d",
      "text": "没有，并没有特别的安排。\n演出结束后，剩下的就是回去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ebefa4e0aea1e92dd0e1ce88853781ee373a8b9c4dcec73357f8ec655665953",
      "text": "太好了！\n当天演出后请把时间空出来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b835555a6d06f1fe145cbf138e622155be4d0fba88fc3a04b52486e05fcf21a7",
      "text": "好，总之先把制作人的\n日程给预定下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:effdaba4cc7b2af76b4754aa90ae54a0ea4cfa87d8ea1b8877fdd1bd588451e1",
      "text": "我的提问是不是太突然了？\n要是引起怀疑了可怎么办……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab2ff6e83eaa9dacd1dcf0dcc61191623d43d01f5e3e6c715006fe11a7325b9c",
      "text": "……没有吧，看起来完全没往心里去，\n应该没什么问题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb638d5cf0bfba56a9eb25954610d6ee95c258c9af40e0d2320b01c3a1ed0792",
      "text": "嗯。之后只要在当天演出结束后，\n跟制作人联络一下就没问题了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c2f8094f22146b569445c3d995c8773a8b9541b4163fc8b451f3d525d57828f",
      "text": "稍微有点紧张呢。\n希望能顺利进行。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
